{{PageBanner|Powerpro banner en.png|event}}
A collaboration event between [[Nyanko Daisensou]] and the sports game known as '''Power Pro Baseball''' (実況パワフルプロ野球, ''Jikkyō Pawafuru Puro Yakyū'', '''Powerful Pro Baseball Live''') was originally held from January 18th, 2018 to February 1st, 2018. The collaboration includes an [[Power Pro Baseball Collaboration Event/Gacha Drop|exclusive Gacha]], stages, [[Catnip Challenges]] and stamps going on during collaboration period.<br>
The game is published by [[wikipedia:Konami|Konami]].

==Event Information==
{{Color|#FF0000|'''PowerPro Baseball'''}} teams up with The Battle Cats for an awesome collaboration series!<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''On between February 15th (11:00am) and March 1st, 2018 (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF0000|'''● PowerPro Baseball Collab Capsules!'''}}<br>
Head to the Battle Cats Rare Capsules for a chance to pick up six powerful crossover characters from PowerPro Baseball!

[[Saki Nijima (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Saki Nijima (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Area attacks that slow Floating & Black enemies!<br>
[[Subaru Hoshi (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''Subaru Hoshi (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Strong vs. Red & Angels, with long-range area attacks!<br>
[[Miyabi Oyama (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|'''Miyabi Oyama (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Area attack power increases after taking damage!<br>
[[Aoi Hayakawa (Super Rare Cat)|{{Color|#008000|'''Aoi Hayakawa (Super Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Massive anti-Alien area damage!<br>
[[Mizuki Tachibana (Super Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF6D01|'''Mizuki Tachibana (Super Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Massive anti-Angel area damage!<br>
[[Hijiri Rokudo (Super Rare Cat)|{{Color|#AA33CC|'''Hijiri Rokudo (Super Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Strong versus Zombies!

<small><small>※ During the crossover campaign period, you will have a set chance to collect one of the PowerPro Baseball collab units from the PowerPro Baseball capsule set. PowerPro Baseball units can not be collected from other Rare Capsule sets. Please make sure that you have selected the PowerPro Baseball capsule set by tapping the icon at the top of the Rare Capsule Machine page.<br>
※ If the PowerPro Baseball capsule set does not appear, make sure that your Battle Cats app is updated to the most recent version.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF0000|'''●Collab stages in The Battle Cats!'''}}<br>
A summer you won't soon forget! Aim for glory with a team of wild characters at your back!<br>
Take on PowerPro Baseball heroes as mighty rivals and earn sweet rewards!<br>
Head to the Event Stages/Stories of Legend to test your skills in {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''Sophomore Summer!'''}}<br>
Clearing this stage in less time will earn you a higher score and even more rewards!<br>
Plus, clearing any stage in this map will give you a chance to earn the limited crossover character [[Akio Yabe (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Akio Yabe'''}}]]!<br>
<small><small>※ If the PowerPro Baseball content does not appear, make sure that your Battle Cats app is updated to the most recent version.<br>
※ Check out rewards for Timed Score stages by tapping the Timed Score button on the map screen.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Win the heart of PowerPro's lovely managers in limited Blitz Stages!'''}}<br>
Take on these Expert difficulty stages and earn the affection of PowerPro Baseball's gorgeous heroines in the Date Chance series! One or more of these stages will appear daily at the times shown below:<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''6:00am～8:59am / 12:00pm～2:59pm / 6:00pm～8:59pm / 9:00pm～11:00pm'''}}

・Clear the collab stage [[Power Pro Baseball Collaboration Event#Date Chance: Karin|{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''Date Chance:  Karin'''}}]]<br>
for a chance to pick up the limited crossover character [[Karin Nekozuka (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|'''Karin Nekozuka!'''}}]]<br>
・Clear the collab stage [[Power Pro Baseball Collaboration Event#Date Chance: Misaki| {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''Date Chance: Misaki'''}}]]<br>
for a chance to pick up the limited crossover character [[Misaki Konno (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|'''Misaki Konno!'''}}]]<br>
・Clear the collab stage [[Power Pro Baseball Collaboration Event#Date Chance: Sairi|{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''Date Chance: Sairi'''}}]]<br>
for a chance to pick up the limited crossover character [[Sairi Nijitani (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|'''Sairi Nijitani!'''}}]]<br>
・Clear the collab stage [[Power Pro Baseball Collaboration Event#Date Chance: Ren|{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''Date Chance: Ren'''}}]]<br>
for a chance to pick up the limited crossover character [[Ren Katagiri (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|'''Ren Katagiri!'''}}]]<br>
<small><small>※ Higher-difficulty stages on each map will provide a greater chance of collecting the named character upon stage clear.<br>
※ Treasure Radars may be used on any stage for a 100% chance to unlock the named unit as a reward upon stage clear. ※ Unlocked characters can be activated at the Rare Cats section of the Upgrade menu.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Unlock Akio Yabe's True Form!'''}}<br>
Starting February 22nd (11:00am), the Deadly-difficulty stage {{Color|#FF0000|'''Prof. Wild's Challenge'''}} will appear!<br>
Can you defeat a well-drilled team of tough enemies in this limited edition challenge? Clear this randomly-appearing Blitz stage for a chance to unlock {{Color|#FF6D01|'''Akio Yabe's True Form'''}}!<br>
<small><small>※ Higher-difficulty stages on each map will provide a greater chance of unlocking the True Form upon stage clear.<br>
※ Treasure Radars may be used on any stage for a 100% chance to unlock the reward upon stage clear.<br>
※ Akio Yabe can be collected by clearing the limited stage Sophomore Summer.<br>
※ Even if Akio Yabe has not been unlocked, it is possible to collect Akio Yabe's True Form. Once the character has been collected and all conditions met, it will then be possible to level him up to his third form.<br>
※ Akio Yabe must be upgraded to level 20 before his True Form can be used.</small></small>

Plus, clearing any collab map for the {{Color|#FF00CC|'''first time will provide a bonus reward of 30 Cat Food!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Special collab missions in the Catnip Challenges!'''}}<br>
Take on Special Mission challenges and earn delightful bonus rewards by playing limited-time-only PowerPro Baseball events!<br>
<small><small>※PowerPro Baseball Special Missions will only appear in the Catnip Challenges until March 1st, 2018 at 11am. You must accept all rewards before the mission disappears at the end of the Catnip Challenges event!</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Limited Edition Gamatoto Event: Go Go Gunder!'''}}<br>
PowerPro Baseball's Gunder appears to support the brave Gamatoto explorers! Earn extra item rewards from every expedition when Gunder is around!<br>
Only during this event, you can send your Gamatoto adventurer to the {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''Cats Eye Cave'''}} and {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''XP Harvest'''}} limited areas for a special set of Cats Eye rewards!<br>
Get as many Cats Eyes as you can and help your units break through to even higher levels!<br>
Don't miss this special chance!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Login Rewards Every Day!'''}}<br>
Awesome login bonuses, available to collect only during this collab event!<br>
Visit The Battle Cats each day during this collab campaign to pick up every stamp and get a Rare Ticket, battle items and other rewards!<br>
Don't forget to login or you'll miss out!

<small><small>※「PowerPro Baseball」is also known as「JIKKYOU PAWAFURU PUROYAKYU(baseball game)」</small></small>

For more information about the PowerPro Baseball app, please visit:
https://www.konami.com/pawa/app/

